HBONUS - Timed XP and gold events

Everyone: hbonus (or hbonus status)
Moderators, implementors, admins and owners:
  hbonus start <xp|gold|both> <multiplier> <minutes>
  hbonus stop

Moderators/Implementors: whole-number x1-x5, 1-60 minutes.
Admins: whole-number x1-x10, 1-1440 minutes.
Owners: whole-number x1-x20, 1-1440 minutes.
x1 means ordinary rewards for that event. Staff may stop events started
by their own rank or lower. Moderators and implementors are equal peers.
One event can run at a time; stop it explicitly before starting another.
Example: hbonus start both 2 60

The event affects newly earned monster-kill XP and newly dropped monster
gold for everyone. It does not multiply PvP rewards, quests, shops, trades,
bank transfers, existing coins or manually assigned rewards. Coin piles
already dropped keep their value after the event ends. Bonuses never stack.

Events survive restarts and expire automatically using the saved end time.
Starting and stopping are announced and audited. Corrupt event storage uses
normal rewards and refuses management until repaired; it never boosts them.
Use ordinary save/quit to retain earned rewards. Training rules still apply.
